/// One `select_factory_ai_mask` error case: `expected_field` is
/// `FactoryAiMaskError`'s declaration-order index (0 levelMode, 1
/// battleMode, 2 factoryWinStreak, 3 trainerOpponentId) — error PRESENCE
/// and site are pinned, not TS's exact RangeError message text.
#[derive(Debug, Clone, Copy, PartialEq, Eq)]
